title: "TransientTrack"
message: "If you use this software or the pretrained models, please cite the associated publication."
abstract: >-
  A deep learning framework for cell tracking in multi-channel fluorescence
  microscopy videos with transient signals, jointly detecting mitosis and
  apoptosis to reconstruct complete trajectories with lineage information.
